# Test infrastructure for every pass of this suite: PickleTools' film steps, and nothing else.
#
# The staging reads this file on every pass that names no map of its own, so the bare pass stages the tool: the
# scenario "the halo filmed one picture per tick" uses two of its steps and must run in every pass, not only in a
# named one - a scenario tagged @wip to keep it out of the other passes is a scenario that is skipped, and the
# owner does not accept one left that way. The tool is not an optional integration of the mod under test: it is
# how the suite films, and it changes nothing in the game the mod runs in.
#
# nelim.pickletools.filmticks is a folder of this repository's collection, not a Workshop item: the staging reads a
# `path:` line as a folder relative to the collection's root.
nelim.pickletools.filmticks   path:PickleTools/FilmTicks/Mod
